<title>USA: American Rice repays $1 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>American Rice repays $1 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Rice Inc said on Wednesday that it has repurchased $1 million in principal of its $100 million 13 percent mortgage notes due 2002.</p>
<p>The company started a tender offer on December 6, 1996 to purchase $5.4 million in principal, the company said.</p>
